      "content": "i guess. but even if i try to build that \"sanctuary,\" it's still just a temporary distraction from the fact that everything is decay. the struggle to keep going just feels like unnecessary friction. if everything is destined to be nothing, isn't the most rational, peaceful thing to just stop fighting it? to just lean into the entropy instead of pretending we can win? it feels like we're just prolonging the inevitable discomfort.",
